{# A section's badge, in the section's OWN colour — resolved by
   Service\SectionDescriber through Core\Member\SectionService::
   colorForSection(), never from a name.

   The colour is an inline style because it is data, not a theme choice:
   it comes from the federation's branch colours or from an
   administrator's explicit override, and there is no utility class for
   "whatever this unit configured". White text is safe on all of them —
   every branch colour is a mid-to-dark tone. #}
<span class="badge rounded-pill text-white" style="background-color: {{ section.color }}">{{ section.name }}</span>
